      "speaker_id": "editorial",
      "text": "Sleep, sustained strength and the boon condition each change the story in a different way: Yoganidra’s withdrawal makes awakening possible, Vishnu endures the long struggle, and the demons’ own condition opens the way to its end."
    },
    {
      "box": {
