      "source_script_hash": "f43cd888268cdb206c3efc6332ab99336e12ae5a3cf5cc97f477320451906655",
      "speaker_id": "editorial",
      "text": "For family conversation: When a problem will not yield to force, what condition might be holding it in place? What can change when that condition is understood?"
